\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Dollar closed higher at S/ 3.917, despite \uc2 BCR \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The price of the dollar in \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed higher on Thursday, due to a renewed aversion to risky assets, with traders' attention focused on the moves to be made by central banks in their efforts to control inflation.\par \par \uc2 The exchange rate ended at S/ 3.917 per dollar, an advance of 0.66% against Wednesday's close at S/ 3.891, according to data from the \uc2 Central Reserve Bank of Peru\uc2  (\uc2 BCR\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the greenback accumulates a decline of 1.85% compared to the last quotation of 2021 at S/ 3.991.\par \par \uc2 "During the day, US$ 210 million were traded at an average price of S/ 3.9124, the supply came from corporates and the demand came from non-resident companies. Today, the market was under upward pressure due to the maturity of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps for S/ 439.5 million", said Asvim Asencios, \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Renta4 SAB.\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 BCR\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with an exchange swap sale for S/ 200 million for three months at an average rate of 2.34% and sold US$ 50 million at an average exchange rate of S/ 3.915 trying to stop the depreciation of the sol", he added.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, in the parallel market or the main exchange houses, the dollar is bought at S/ 3.890 and sold at S/ 3.920, according to the portal cuantoestaeldolar.pe.\par \par \uc2 Regionally, Latin American stock markets were trading with losses on Thursday, due to a renewed aversion to risky assets, with traders' attention focused on the moves to be made by central banks in their efforts to control inflation.\par \par \uc2 According to Reuters, the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\uc2 ECB\uc2 ) announced a 50 basis point hike to control inflation, in the first interest rate increase since 2011, while the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed) monetary policy meeting will be held between July 26 and 27.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220721ei7l00frx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
