iated an arbitration process at the UNCID, which is currently in process.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Moreover, from 2018 to date, the Peruvian Government ('the Grantor') has been evaluating the modification of the Concession Contract, to determine a mechanism that allow the completion of the project, without resolution as of to date.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Finally, the Grantor and the Ministry of Agriculture and Irrigation (MINAGRI), and the Chavimochic Special Project, have signed an Agreement in order to allow MINAGRI to subrogate the ownership of the Project, within the framework of the provisions of the Emergency Decree N \u176\'00\'B0 021-2020.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 14.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PROPERTY, PLANT AND EQUIPMENT, INTANGIBLE ASSETS AND RIGHT-OF-USE ASSETS\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The movement in property, plant and equipment, intangible assets and right-of-use assets accounts for the periods ended June 30, 2020 and 2021, is as follows:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                 Property, plant andequipment              Intangiblesassets       Right-of-useassets  \par                                                              (a)                            (b)                      (a)  \par                                                                                                                                        \par Net cost at January 1, 2020                                      463,990                          854,227                    90,581    \par Additions                                                        18,896                           40,691                     7,979     \par Reclassifications and disposals                                  (9,960)  \{2\}                     (23,648)           \{2\}     (10,046) \{2\}\par Conversion adjustments                                           (1,945)  \{2\}                     (5,654)            \{2\}     (422)    \{2\}\par Deductions for sale of assets                       