\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Dollar, GDP and others...\b0\par\par\uc2 415 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Patricio Quintanilla Paulet\par \par \uc2 Rector U La Salle\par \par \uc2 In recent days, there have been important economic developments, some positive, but most worrying.\par \par \uc2 Dollar PriceAt the end of the week, the exchange rate has reached S/ 3.954, the highest level in recent times, which is due to several reasons, which have coincided at this time. Internationally, demand for this \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has increased due to the announcement by the \uc2 Federal Reserve System\uc2  (FED), the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the United States, which would reduce monetary stimuli, including an increase in the interest rate.\par \par \uc2 At the local level, the political uncertainty that still remains, has motivated that the market operators have increased their demand, with the consequent pressure on the price.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\uc2 BCR\uc2 ) has been actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, with significant sales of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has led, among other reasons, to a reduction of more than 5,000 million dollars in Net International Reserves (RIN); had it not, the price of the dollar would be much higher. Despite this, Peru's RIN level is one of the highest in Latin America.\par \par \uc2 National ProductionAs usual, the National Institute of Statistics and Informatics (INEI), on the 15th of each month publishes the behavior of GDP, with figures from two months ago; so last Tuesday it reported that the GDP of the month of April has grown by 58.5% with respect to the same of the year 2020, but it should be taken into account that this period had a strong contraction due to the pandemic; the level of April 2019, pre-pandemic, has not yet been reached.\par \par \uc2 In the first quarter of the year, growth was 3.8%, showing the beginning of a slow process of recovery, but with a positive trend; at the southern level, the regions of Ica, Moquegua and Arequipa have grown at a rate higher than the national average.\par \par \uc2 The region with the highest growth is Ica with a rate of 11.7%, supported by the mining production of zinc and iron, thus confirming the importance of this productive sector.\par \par \uc2 The Inflation Report published last Friday by the \uc2 BCR\uc2 , maintains a projection of GDP growth for this year at 10.7%\par \par \uc2 Metal PriceThe recent increase in the international price of the dollar, has affected the price of copper, which this Friday has had a fall; the level is still very high, but it has been reduced to mid-April.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020210620eh6k0043k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw109\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1635\pichgoal600
