\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Sun falls for third day despite exchange  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 :  \highlight22\uc2 Peru FX \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 (Bloomberg) -- The Peruvian sun declined for the third day, while continued \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped limit losses, but failed to reverse the trend. The Peruvian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened 0.08% to 3.62 soles per dollar on Tuesday and lost more than 0.3% of its value in three days.\par \par \uc2 The bank sold 130 million suns in swaps six months after selling 249 million suns in swaps and US$7 million in the spot market on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has remained weak beyond the 50-day moving average since last Monday, with the moving average now stood at 3,6042.\par \par \uc2 The december 22 minimum at 3,6220 is considered short-term support from the sun and if it crosses that level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could test the November 17 low at 3.64.\par \par \uc2 Most investors are reluctant to buy suns before the end of the year, regardless of the external environment, according to a trader.\par \par \uc2 (Some of the information comes from \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders familiar with transactions that requested not to be identified because they are not authorized to speak publicly).\par \par \uc2 Original Note:PEN Declines for a Third Day Amid \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Support: Inside Peru\par \par \uc2 NOTE: George Lei is a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strata that he writes for Bloomberg. The observations you make are your own and are not intended to be investment advice.\par \par \uc2 