\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-\uc2 Peru  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  hints at interest rate hike next month\b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 2015\par 19:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds chief economist comments, background on Peru \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , inflation)\par \par \uc2 LIMA, Nov 13 (Reuters) - \uc2 Peru's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might raise the benchmark interest rate next month from 3.5 percent if inflation rises quicker than expected, the bank's chief economist said on Friday, hinting at a hike as the falling exchange value of Peru's sol threatens to heat up prices in the country.\par \par \uc2 A spike in food costs so far this month indicates that the rise in consumer prices in November will be "somewhat more" than October's 0.14 percent increase, said chief economist Adrian Armas.\par \par \uc2 "But we'll have to see the evolution of prices in the second half of November, because... there can be quick corrections," Armas said on a conference call with reporters.\par \par \uc2 Armas said the sol \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's renewed slide against the U.S. dollar would have an impact on inflation, which had cooled to 3.66 percent in October. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's inflation target rate is 1 percent to 3 percent.\par \par \uc2 "The bank expects inflation to converge to the target range next year, and thus we are looking at how inflation goes this month," Armas said the call.\par \par \uc2 "It's possible the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raises the interest rate in December if inflation conditions are not what the bank expects," he added.\par \par \uc2 The sol has weakened nearly 1.5 percent against the dollar in the past two weeks on expectations for higher U.S. interest rates, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's frequent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market. (Reporting By Teresa Cespedes; Editing by Chris Reese and Bill Rigby) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-11-13T19:48:19.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020151113ebbd00omk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
