\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Peru's sol slips to 9-yr low despite  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  support\b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 2015\par 21:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds context, details)\par \par \uc2 By Ursula Scollo\par \par \uc2 LIMA, Aug 21 (Reuters) - Peru's sol slipped 0.31 percent on Friday to end the trading session at its weakest level in more than nine years despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sale of $270 million in the local spot market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The sol's losses followed news of shrinking manufacturing activity in China, one of the main buyers of Peru's key mineral exports.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has ramped up its market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks as the sol's slide accelerates ahead of an expected interest rate hike in the United States and following China's devaluation of the yuan.\par \par \uc2 The sol has weakened 2.44 percent against the dollar so far this month even with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling $1.3 billion to prop it up.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it expects volatility in the local spot market to continue until the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  decides on rates in September.\par \par \uc2 In the meantime, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Julio Velarde has said the bank still has plenty of dollar reserves to deploy to soften \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings.\par \par \uc2 The sol finished trading at 3.269/3.270 per dollar, its weakest since June 2006. (Reporting By Ursula Scollo; Editing by Steve Orlofsky and Alan Crosby) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-8-21T20:57:49.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150821eb8l00p0g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
