2 \f2 5. Taxation\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For the six months ended 31 December 2014, the GBP276 million taxation charge from continuing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (2013 -GBP388 million) comprises a UK tax charge of GBP60 million (2013 - GBP37 million) and a foreign tax charge of GBP216 million (2013 - GBP351 million).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 6. Inventories\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                        31 December      30 June  31 December \par                                               2014         2014         2013 \par                                        GBP million  GBP million  GBP million \par  \par Raw materials and consumables                  386          306          387 \par Work in progress                                95           59           65 \par Maturing inventories                         3,470        3,300        3,234 \par Finished goods and goods for resale            646          557          634 \par                                        -----------  -----------  ----------- \par                                              4,597        4,222        4,320 \par                                        ===========  ===========  =========== \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 29-01-15 0701GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 7. Net borrowings\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                            31 December      30 June  31 December \par                                                   2014         2014         2013 \par                                            GBP million  GBP million  GBP million \par  \par Borrowings due within one year and \par  bank overdrafts                               (2,845)      (1,576)      (3,007) \par Borrowings due after one year                  (8,518)      (7,638)      (6,716) \par Fair value of foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  forwards \par  and swaps                                  